WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.139 --> 00:00:11.329
In tutorial 10.5, you'll update your
company, check your websites, and pause,

00:00:11.379 --> 00:00:13.610
remove or leave what you no longer need.

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:17.880
First, open Company
settings, on the Company tab.

00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:22.883
Company details holds your company
name, industry, size and main website.

00:00:23.797 --> 00:00:27.630
Change what you need, like the
industry, then click Save changes.

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:34.415
If you left the guided setup early,
Setup is not finished shows here.

00:00:34.465 --> 00:00:37.109
Click Continue setup to
pick up where you stopped.

00:00:38.326 --> 00:00:41.596
Next, Websites lists every
website in your company,

00:00:41.646 --> 00:00:45.108
with whether it's verified and
whether weekly tracking is on.

00:00:46.076 --> 00:00:48.901
Click Settings to open a
website's own settings,

00:00:48.951 --> 00:00:51.100
or Add a website to add another one.

00:00:52.622 --> 00:00:56.712
To take a website away, click its
Settings, and choose the Delete tab.

00:00:58.601 --> 00:01:03.501
Delete website removes it from your company,
and you'll type its name to confirm.

00:01:03.551 --> 00:01:06.580
To add it back later, you'd
need to verify it again.

00:01:07.544 --> 00:01:10.794
Only want a break? Click
Pause tracking instead.

00:01:10.844 --> 00:01:14.819
It opens Tracking & monitors,
where Pause stops the weekly work.

00:01:14.869 --> 00:01:17.215
Click Resume when you're
ready to start again.

00:01:18.198 --> 00:01:21.249
Team members who aren't the
owner can leave a company.

00:01:21.299 --> 00:01:24.371
They'll find Leave beside
their own name, under Team.

00:01:25.674 --> 00:01:28.439
Click Leave, and confirm
with Leave company.

00:01:28.489 --> 00:01:31.505
You lose access until an
admin invites you again.

00:01:32.724 --> 00:01:36.484
As the owner, you'll find the Danger
zone at the bottom of Company.

00:01:36.534 --> 00:01:41.034
Delete company removes its reports,
files and your team's access.

00:01:41.084 --> 00:01:43.688
Here too, you'll type its name to confirm.

00:01:44.722 --> 00:01:49.022
Now your company's details are current,
every website is where you want it,

00:01:49.072 --> 00:01:51.121
and your team has the right access.

00:01:52.136 --> 00:01:57.246
So, update your details, finish setup,
check your websites, pause or delete one,

00:01:57.296 --> 00:01:59.080
and leave or delete a company.

00:02:00.064 --> 00:02:02.514
Your company is in order. Next,

00:02:02.564 --> 00:02:07.303
send alerts to Slack or
Microsoft Teams in tutorial 11.1.
